{
  "$meta": {
    "name": "LesTool Design System",
    "style": "Swiss Precision — Minimalism & Swiss Style × 深色优先",
    "style_source": "ui-ux-pro-max: styles.csv minimalism-and-swiss-style + typography.csv 'Modern Dark Cinema' 气质（WPF 落地为 Segoe UI + Microsoft YaHei，zh-CN 桌面规则）",
    "decided": "2026-10-21",
    "decision": "用户未指定参考，由推荐方向定案：OLED 风排除（浅色主题 not-recommended），Flat 青绿风排除（网页创业气质，与效率工具不符）。延续旧版靛蓝 accent 色相（#7C9AFF/#4C6FE0 家族）以 base #4C6FE0 重新生成整档。 2026-10-21 二次调整（散光舒适度）：黑白两端向中间收（浅端 lightest 96→91、深端 darkest 21→23），深色文字三档对比 14.7/11.2/8.2 → 约 10/7.5/5.8，浅色 14.7/7.9/5.7 → 约 9.8/5.8/4.8；危险/成功色随之各降一档（贴 4.5 底线但全过）。",
    "layers": [
      "primitive：算法生成的原始刻度（generate_palette.py §5.3.3/§5.4/§5.5.1）+ 书定标尺（字号/间距/圆角/字重/阴影）",
      "semantic：dark/light 两棵语义树，键名即 WPF 消费端键名（TextPrimary、NavAccent…），与旧契约一致",
      "WPF 落地：Themes/tokens.xaml（emit_tokens.py 生成）+ Themes/Dark|Light.xaml（tools/emit_themes.py 生成）+ Themes/Design.xaml（手写隐式样式；旧契约常量键 FontSize*/CornerRadius*/ControlHeight/CaptionHeight 以 StaticResource 别名指向 tokens.xaml，零重复）"
    ],
    "invariants": [
      "所有数值唯一来源 = 本文件。禁止手改 tokens.xaml / Dark.xaml / Light.xaml；改本文件后重新生成",
      "文字只许两字重：weight.normal 400 / weight.emphasis 600",
      "文字只许三档对比层级，且每档对所在背景 ≥4.5:1（pairs 矩阵门禁，改值必须复跑 check_contrast）",
      "间距一律 space 刻度（4/8/12/16/24/32/48/64）；<4px 的微间隙视作描边级，不受此限",
      "描边一律 1px（选中/强调环 2px）；圆角只许 radius.control / radius.overlay 两档",
      "全局唯一强调色 = primary 族（WPF 键 NavAccent）；危险/成功色只作语义，不作装饰"
    ],
    "regen": [
      "python \"C:/Users/armstrong/.agents/skills/refactoring-ui/scripts/generate_palette.py\" --grey --temperature cool --lightest 91 --darkest 23 --extended --name neutral --json",
      "python \"C:/Users/armstrong/.agents/skills/refactoring-ui/scripts/generate_palette.py\" --base '#4C6FE0' --extended --name primary --json",
      "python \"C:/Users/armstrong/.agents/skills/refactoring-ui/scripts/generate_palette.py\" --base '#D13438' --toward cool --extended --name danger --json",
      "python \"C:/Users/armstrong/.agents/skills/refactoring-ui/scripts/generate_palette.py\" --base '#2E9E5B' --extended --name success --json",
      "python \"C:/Users/armstrong/.agents/skills/refactoring-ui/scripts/emit_tokens.py\" design-tokens.json --format xaml --out src/LesTool/Themes",
      "python \"C:/Users/armstrong/.agents/skills/refactoring-ui/scripts/emit_tokens.py\" design-tokens.json --format preview --out docs",
      "python tools/emit_themes.py",
      "python \"C:/Users/armstrong/.agents/skills/refactoring-ui/scripts/check_contrast.py\" --matrix design-tokens.json",
      "design-skins.json 维护皮肤（tools/emit_themes.py 一并读取并生成 src/LesTool/Skins/*.xaml + 对比度门禁）"
    ]
  },
